		line=629,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I flip open my diary for the first time in a long while.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I should no longer have any need to cloister my overflowing sentiments for Onii-sama within these pages.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Unlike before, I can convey all my heart's desires to him whenever we meet.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"And yet, I cannot bring myself to speak of these feelings of mine, even to him.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"...For I am terrified of just how he might answer me.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"And so, I put into words all of these ineffable feelings that must never be said aloud.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'Onii-sama, you have lain with me many a time now.'”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'Your Kanami is overjoyed that you have accepted her love in spite of the fact that we are brother and sister.'”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'And yet, I cannot help but feel ill at ease.'”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"My pen lingers above the page as I contemplate whether I should continue.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"If someone were to find this diary, all the details of my sordid relationship with Onii-sama would be laid bare.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"But irrepressibly, my feelings continue to take shape as ink on the page before me.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'Onii-sama, you have accepted the noble task of protecting Miyaguni-sama, the true heir to the Imperial\nFamily.'”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'I cannot bear the thought that when the time comes, my love for you might interfere with your sworn duty.'”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'Such an affair, with one who is your sister, and the Empress at that, is already that which must not be.'”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'It is with this in mind, Onii-sama, that the thought that I ought to sever ties with you weighs heavily on me.'”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"My pen halts in midair as thoughts of Onii-sama fill my mind.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"The very same Onii-sama that accepted my intemperate sisterly love and bestowed upon me carnal knowledge for the first time.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The mere act of thinking back to that night sets my whole body ablaze.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Oh, Onii-sama, how your Kanami yearns for you...",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"But I cannot help but wonder how you truly feel about our relationship.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Oh, Oomikami, would that Onii-sama might feel the same way as I do...",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Unable to bring myself to ask, all I can do is continue penning my true feelings in this diary of mine.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"At this rate, I'll be no different from when I was Okonogi's puppet.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"No... I can't go on forever like this.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"If I never clarify my feelings for Onii-sama, I won't ever be able to properly apply myself to other matters.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Even now, in the course of fulfilling my duties as Empress, my head is filled with nothing but thoughts of him.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I've dedicated myself to becoming a worthy Empress, and I would hate for Onii-sama of all people to be disappointed in me.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"...I've made up my mind. I shall ask Onii-sama by the end of the day.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Facing my diary, I certify my resolve into ink.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I call out as I rap on the door, but there's no response.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I arrived here on her express summons, so might she be in trouble?",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I'm left with no other choice.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I humbly beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Announcing myself, I enter her chambers uninvited.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Kanami is facing her desk, fully absorbed in writing.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She hasn't even made any notice of my intrusion.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"So as to not startle her, I slowly approach and quietly call out only when I'm beside her.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hwaah?!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Kanami notices me and jolts up with a start.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Awawawawa!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoops.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I support her with a hand as she nearly falls from her chair in startlement.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“O-Onii-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I did call out to you several times before I came in.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I-I hadn't noticed at all...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Oh, my heart very nearly leapt out of my chest.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're the one who told me to come at this time.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hweh?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Kanami glances at the clock with a confused look on her face.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"It seems like she totally lost track of time.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I-I'm so sorry! H-How careless of me!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You seemed pretty absorbed in your writing.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I peer over at the contents of her desk.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Kyaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Kanami leaps to flop over her desk with her entire body.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“D-Did you see it...?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I didn't manage to make out the contents. What were you writing?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“U-Umm... it's... my diary.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not anything to be so embarrassed about, is it?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I-It is...! It absolutely is!”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami would immediately perish if anyone were to lay eyes on her diary!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I-I see...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"From her nape of her neck to her hairline, Kanami flushes a bright red.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I can almost make out a puff of steam rising from her head.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"What in the world could she be writing in that diary?",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"With a reaction like that, it only makes me all the more curious.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please wait outside for just a moment, I'll attend to you right away!”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Kanami hastily begins stashing her diary away in a double-locked drawer.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Whatever is written in there, it must be very important to her.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, feel free to take your time.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I'm still curious about its contents, but I withdraw to the hallway all the same.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"On beautiful days such as this one, Kanami always makes time to stroll through the Imperial Gardens.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"And whenever our schedules line up, like today, I'm able to escort her as her bodyguard.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I've been busy recently, so it's been quite a while since I've been able to accompany Kanami like this.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“What a lovely day it is.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Kanami remarks as she gazes up at the clear sky.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"The weather is clear and sunny, just warm enough to make me sweat slightly.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"However, she appears to not be bothered at all by the heat as she pleasantly enjoys her stroll.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Kanami sneaks a glance up at me.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"But I merely shake my head at her without breaking my silence.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Unlike that one precious day we shared between us, we are no longer permitted to speak intimately in public.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"As I am now, I am but a humble bodyguard to the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Understanding, Kanami breaks our gaze with a lonely smile.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"It pains my heart to see her like this, but I mustn't let it show on my face.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"The two of us continue silently strolling through the garden.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"As we continue on, a lone servant tending to the garden notices our presence.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Kanami shows him a kindly smile as he turns to pay his respects.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please, do not mind my presence.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I commend you for your diligent efforts.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Kanami addresses him in a benevolent tone.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Moved by the Empress's consideration, the gardener lays down his tools and offers Kanami a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"─Empress Hisui's disposition has recently become even more fair.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I've heard this opinion shared unanimously among all the servants in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“What seems to be the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Kanami pauses and turns to look at me.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"She's recently become much more proactive in all aspects of her life.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"She's grown to take a much more active role in governance, being able to discuss politics on an equal footing with parliamentary officials.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"On top of that, she often takes the time to study with Akari in the academy library.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"They had a strained relationship in the past, but now,\nthey're the best of friends.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You seemed amused.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Is there a matter you wish to discuss? I would dearly love to hear of it.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Oh, must you really be such a meanie?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Muttering this, Kanami adorably puffs out her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"“Empress Hisui” would never be seen wearing such an expression.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Right now, she comes off as far more innocently girlish than when she addressed the gardener.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I'm the only person Kanami shows this side of herself to.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"When I think of it that way, I can't stop the grin from creeping across my face once again.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"A cool breeze blows across the expansive courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Left in its wake is a serene stillness as we realize that the two of us are all alone, with nobody around to be seen.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Kanami draws a half-step closer to me and gently takes my hand into her own.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"I sense her slightly damp hand clutch mine ever so slightly tighter when I ask my question.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“There is... a matter I wish to speak to you of... Might you be willing to indulge me?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I don't mind.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I prompt her to continue.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"With one last squeeze of my hand, Kanami seems to have steeled her resolve.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama... I would hear from you what you truly think of our relationship...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you perhaps find our liaison to be burdensome?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For instance, regretting having come to know me intimately on that day...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"The dam of her reservations having burst open, Kanami begins spilling her innermost thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Her eyes well up with tears as she recounts her deeply buried anxieties.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I lay my free hand on top of her head as she struggles to find her words.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“U-Um...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Calm down, Kanami. What brought all this on?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I pat her head with one hand as I squeeze her hand reassuringly with my other.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Even though her shoulders are still feebly trembling, the tears at least no longer spill over from her limpid eyes.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take as long as you need... Please, just tell me what's bothering you.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
